sequenceDiagram
    participant ZED2 as Stereo Camera
    participant Orin as Jetson Orin Nano
    participant rmw as ROS Middleware
    participant PC as PC

    ZED2->>+rmw: [1] Capture and Publish Stereo Image Topics
    rmw->>+Orin: [2] convert_image_format nodes subscribe Stereo Image Topics
    Orin->>Orin: [3] convert_image_format (bgra8 -> bgr8)
    Orin->>rmw: [4] convert_image_format nodes publish bgr8 image topics
    rmw->>Orin: [5] image_transport nodes subscribe bgr8 image topics
    Orin->>Orin: [6] image_transport nodes compress bgr8 image topics
    Orin->>rmw: [7] image_transport nodes publish compressed image topics
    rmw->>PC: [8] image_transport nodes subscribe compressed image topics
    PC->>PC: [9] image_transport nodes decompress image topics
    PC->>rmw: [10] image_transport nodes publish raw image topics
    rmw->>PC: [11] rtabmap_viz node subscribes raw image topics
    rmw->>PC: [11] rviz2 node subscribes raw image topics
    rmw->>Orin: [5] stereo_odometry node subscribes bgr8 image topics
    Orin->>Orin: [6] stereo_odometry computes Odometry
    Orin->>rmw: [7] stereo_odometry publishes Odometry Data
    rmw->>PC: [8] rtabmap_viz node subscribes Odometry Data
    rmw->>PC: [8] rviz2 node subscribes Odometry Data
    rmw->>Orin: [8] rtabmap node subscribes Odometry Data
    rmw->>Orin: [5] rtabmap node subscribes bgr8 Images
    Orin->>Orin: [9] rtabmap computes keypoints, map data, point cloud etc.
    Orin->>rmw: [10] rtabmap publishes keypoints, map data, point cloud etc.
    rmw->>PC: [11] rtabmap_viz node subscribes keypoints, map data, point cloud etc.
    rmw->>PC: [11] rviz2 node subscribes keypoints, map data, point cloud etc.
    PC->>PC: [12] rtabmap_viz node displays keypoints, map data, point cloud etc.
    PC->>PC: [12] rviz2 node displays keypoints, map data, point cloud etc.

